WEBVTT

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:16.200
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.080
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.580
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.120
spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.700
After saving the Forest of Elidora,
Kasel convinced Lorraine

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:35.040
to remove a seal on the Holy Sword Aea.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:40.580
He continues his journey to visit
the next person who can undo a seal:

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.540
Aeatola, the orc chieftain.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.290
The Holy Sword is Lua's Curse.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:52.450
Will you become Lua's puppet as well?

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:27.910
<i></i>Maven

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:27.910
<i></i>of Fire

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:32.660
There's still a long ways to go.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:37.870
Yeah, I didn't expect meeting
the orc chieftain to be easy.

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:41.580
We just have to push on towards Ogria Mountain.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:45.240
Yes. We're nearing another town.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:50.120
It's famous for many sightseeing spots
and great signature foods.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:54.370
Omelets, sausages, even spiders for Kasel!

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.740
Really? I'm looking forward to that.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:05.080
You really can't stop treating this
as a sightseeing trip, can you?

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.740
That's not fair.

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:10.950
I just thought everyone looks tired,
so I wanted to cheer everyone up.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:13.660
Come on, we're almost there. Let's go!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:20.790
This is one of the towns
I wanted to visit for a long time...

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.370
So excited!

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.040
This is quite a lively town.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:33.290
Guys, over here!

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.660
Wow...

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:39.240
I wonder how much this costs...?

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.540
Hey, sir!

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.910
Give me everything you got here!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:04.950
Eat up, you need energy!

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:07.040
R-Right...

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.450
Kasel, have some extra.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:14.080
What? Are you sure? Thank you.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:16.620
You're welcome.

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:21.450
There's a sightseeing spot over that way,
called the Fountain of Krall.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:23.080
Can we stop by?

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:27.490
No, we don't have time for that.
We have to push on.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.660
Come on, just for a little bit?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.370
No.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:35.700
This town was engulfed in war
about 30 years ago.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:38.080
It was on the verge of being destroyed.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:44.620
But the surviving residents banded together,
held their heads up high,

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:49.490
and rebuilt the town as a sightseeing center,
according to a book I read.

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:53.200
Isn't that wonderful?
Don't you want to support them?

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.790
Well... Yes.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.790
Then we have to go sightseeing.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.200
Huh? Um...

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:05.700
If we go right through this town,
we'll be sleeping outside tonight.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:09.290
Yes. We've been camping outside
every night for a while now.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:13.080
Tonight, we should find
a nice inn and rest well.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:17.450
I guess that means it makes sense for us
to spend the whole day today in town...

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:21.370
Yeah. And since we're here, let's enjoy!

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:47.990
Cleo, what's going on?

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:53.080
This is all the money we have left.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.490
I'm sorry!

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:57.120
I'm sorry!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:06:01.580
I'm sorry. I should have been
a stricter babysitter...

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:05.950
There's no point in dwelling on the past.
I guess we're camping out again...

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:12.160
What? No way. I want to sleep in a fluffy bed!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.950
You shouldn't be talking.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:18.370
Don't worry. In a town like this,
there should be plenty of ways to make money.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.830
Sit tight! I'll find us some work.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.410
Work...?

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:30.990
This place will pay us
and let us stay at an empty room!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.870
I'll work in the kitchen!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.660
I guess I'm serving on the floor...

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:45.870
Making good tea for customers? Got it.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:54.120
Everyone's looking good!

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:55.040
What about me...?

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:57.870
Oh, they said Kasel can stay as-is.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.540
I see...

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:02.700
Okay, let's make some money!

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:07.620
Welcome.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:11.990
Thank you for waiting.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:31.620
The Holy Sword is Lua's Curse.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:34.990
Will you become Lua's puppet as well?

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:39.450
What in the world did that mean...?

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:45.160
King Kyle fought to protect everyone...

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.830
How can the Holy Sword be a curse...?

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.080
What is she doing?

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:08.790
There.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.740
You're a sorceress?!

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:13.740
Show us more magic!

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:18.240
No, no. Magic isn't for show, it's precious.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:20.040
But I want to see.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.870
Please, Chef Cleo!

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:25.830
Oh, really? Well...

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:28.700
Just a little bit, then...

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.240
There.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.490
Go.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:43.660
Get water! Hurry!

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:48.330
I'm sorry!

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:55.790
I guess this is better than
camping out in the mountains...

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.910
Cleo seems very depressed...

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:01.910
I've never seen Cleo look so sad.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:05.290
She should really reflect on her actions.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:10.830
In the Tower of the Sage,
Cleo is seen as a genius with a bright future,

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:14.580
but she just doesn't know
about the outside world.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:20.290
Also, given her personality,
she sometimes does outrageous things.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.620
Has she done something before?

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.490
She blew up an entire building.

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.240
What?

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:30.080
Fortunately, nobody was hurt.

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:36.540
Dominix said, Cleo needs to figure out
how to put her potential to use.

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:42.790
Cleo, can I sleep next to you?

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.740
It's getting cold, so we should stick together.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:47.120
Sure...

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:53.660
This makes it look like a star.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:57.200
That thing... I'm sorry.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.040
I couldn't even imagine this would happen...

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:04.830
No, I'm glad you got me this.
I'll treat it well.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.910
Frey, you're kind.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:13.950
I wonder. If I had an older sister,
would she be like you?

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:15.160
Cleo...

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:22.080
I don't remember my mother's face--
she passed away when I was small.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:24.910
I see...

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:27.660
The only thing I remember is...

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:35.990
Wow, awesome! I want to be
a great sorceress like you, mom!

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:42.240
The stronger you become, the more
sadness there will be. Don't forget that.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:46.740
I haven't figured out what that means, but...

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:52.540
If my mother was still alive, there is so much
I would have wanted to ask her...

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:57.410
Yes... But I think, if you
practice your magic more,

00:10:57.410 --> 00:11:01.240
you'll understand what your mother meant.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.790
Do you really think so?

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:07.700
You're still connected to
your mother through magic.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:13.160
Still... Yes, you might be right...

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:21.870
Good night, Cleo.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:27.200
Wake up, Kasel!

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:31.910
Hmm, where's Roi?

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:34.200
Look at this.

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:38.330
"Will go make some money. Roi"?

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:40.410
Cleo's missing, too...

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.370
Hey, guys!

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.790
I found work!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:49.910
It's a restaurant in the outskirts
of town called Madam Volf's...

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.660
Hmm? Where's Roi?

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:58.870
I see... Nowhere to be found.

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:02.410
It's the past--let it go.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.290
I need to sell this off.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:14.200
Is there really a restaurant
all the way out here?

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:17.240
It's just grass and rocks...

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:20.200
What are these big rocks lying around for?

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:23.080
Hey, look!

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:29.370
Huh? So you want to work here?

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:32.080
Y-Yes...

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:36.330
Well, get started then.
There's a ton of stuff to do!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:37.950
Y-Yes...

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.200
This is going to be tough...

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:55.450
It does indeed look like a lot of work.
I'm getting excited!

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:57.410
Right, I'll do my best, too!

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:04.490
Fix it up already.
Are you going to take all day?

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:07.620
So slow. Be quicker!

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.740
There!

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:20.160
Ah, so you're a sorceress?

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:21.450
That's right.

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:25.580
That means you can work
a thousand times harder.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:26.910
Huh...?

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.870
Clean the lamps!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.160
Fix the roof!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.950
Scrub the floors!

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:37.080
Does this have anything to do with magic?!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:44.540
Hey, old lady, aren't you overworking me?!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:48.450
"Old lady"? There's nobody with that name here.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:54.660
The only person in this house is me,
the Madam, girl!

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:58.040
I'm not a girl, I'm Cleo.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:01.240
Sure, whatever. Get back to work, girl.

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.160
I said it's Cleo!

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:06.330
Fine, I'll do the work, Madam Wolf.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:08.160
Oops! I mean, Madam Volf.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.160
You said that on purpose.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:15.330
Why would I? Just because you open
your mouth wide like a wolf to nag at me,

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.660
I would never call someone a wolf!

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:23.620
Fine then, I'll shut your noisy trap!

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.450
How do you suppose you'll do that?

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:33.830
Ugh, that Madam!

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:38.080
Where's your wisecracking now, girl?

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:43.870
Cleo does have an attitude,
but that Madam has that and some more...

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:45.700
It's like watching two children fight.

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:50.950
Fine, bring it on, Madam!
What else do you want done?!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.580
Wipe the windows!

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:09.240
Well then. The restaurant is clean,
but you are filthy.

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:10.540
Go take a bath.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:21.490
You must be hungry. Eat up.

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.740
Thank you.

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:27.330
It's delicious...!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.540
I haven't cooked in a long time.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:41.120
This place is in the outskirts,
I rarely get customers.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.870
That's a shame.

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:45.040
Why don't you try advertisement or something?

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:51.330
It's fine. I cook over charcoal.
I can't cook very much too quickly, anyway.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:56.080
If I use my fire magic, I can help--

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:04.830
Fire magic?!

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:07.700
No! Anything but that!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:17.290
I see, so you can use fire magic.
But you can't, not in these parts.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.160
Why...?

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:22.580
This might just be bare land right now,

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:26.580
but it used to be a whole town,
full of travelers.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:30.950
But one day, the war came.

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:36.040
People, houses, chaos, fighting...
They all burned down.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:38.830
Including my family.

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:44.700
The only things that remained were me
and my restaurant.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:49.620
You see those rocks scattered about?
Those are makeshift gravestones.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:54.790
With so many dead,
I couldn't even make proper graves.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:59.330
I didn't know...
There used to be buildings here...

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:02.830
I know more than anyone
how terrifying fire can be.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.740
So please, don't use that magic here.

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:12.580
Madam, my magic is for saving people.
It's not for doing bad things...

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:17.790
The sorcerer back then also tried to protect us.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:21.580
But as a result, caused great tragedy...

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:24.740
The only fire you can use here is charcoal.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:38.160
With a small mistake,
my magic can hurt people very badly...

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:45.620
The stronger you become,
the more sadness there will be.

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:49.290
Maybe this is what my mother tried to tell me...

00:17:58.540 --> 00:17:59.790
Demons!

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.790
No...!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.240
Demons!

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:07.660
Take care of the Madam.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:08.100
Yes!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:10.040
What's going on?!

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:27.490
Kasel!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.580
We'll hold them off here!

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:32.910
Got it!

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:36.450
Again...? Is it happening again?

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:38.950
No, we won't let it.

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:51.410
Run, Madam!

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:52.580
But...

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:55.660
Hurry!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.540
You okay?!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.410
Yeah...

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:08.490
Watch out!

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:21.870
Cleo, use your magic!

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.410
But I can't...

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:25.990
I can't use magic here...!

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.700
No!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:31.950
What have I done...? Because of me, she's...

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.870
Cleo! Use your magic!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:52.740
The present is more precious than the past!

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:54.330
You have to live!

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:05.160
Use your magic, save your friends!

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:12.200
Magic, for protecting my friends...!

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:51.080
Madam, I...

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:58.290
You put your life on the line
to protect your friends.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.490
Madam...

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:12.080
Oh? You have a bit more girth than I thought.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.120
Madam!

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.580
There you are.

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:20.300
Roi!

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:21.990
Where were you?

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:28.200
Roi! You're late! We were just fighting Demons!

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.950
Demons?

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:32.410
I see. Good work.

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:34.450
What is this lack of gravity?!

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:38.200
There, there. See? I made us some money.

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:42.540
Wow! Okay, I'll take good care of this...

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.990
I will manage this from here on.

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:45.990
Yeah.

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.450
Fine.

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:01.290
I think I understand just a little bit now...

00:22:02.490 --> 00:22:05.490
...what it means to wield magical powers.

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:08.540
I can't defend anyone with
a half-hearted attitude...!

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:13.870
All right, let's make this a great day!

00:23:46.950 --> 00:23:49.870
While we continued our travels,

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:51.950
the Black Edge experienced many successes,

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:55.700
and many within the castle
began to support them.

00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:59.790
However, not everyone was happy about that.

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.870
<i></i>The Target

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.870
<i></i>of Hatred
